OL,3,GNEWSAStadium's #2.1m repair plans set
OL,4,Afor approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to spend almost #2.1m to make
OL,7,Frepairs at an athletics stadium in
OL,8,FNottingham are set to be approved.
OL,10,FThe project at the Harvey Hadden
OL,11,FStadium in Bilborough would see the
OL,12,Fathletics track replaced and the stand,
OL,13,Fwhich would have its capacity capped at
OL,14,F499, refurbished.
OL,16,FNottingham City Council's executive
OL,17,Fboard has been recommended to approve
OL,18,Fthe #2.082m project when it meets on 20
OL,19,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
